From 2f0b31d0f63a27ea513c917d945c53c63689442c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chiro <chiro2001@163.com>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 16:25:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 271/274] feat(avx2): native iota/compare/where
 position-control plane (payload 7)

- add the PXIO/PXCP/PXWH v1 descriptor wire with fnv1a64 digests; bump
  ARTIFACT_PAYLOAD_VERSION 6->7 and NATIVE_ABI_MARKER pypto-x.cpu.avx2:7->:8
- execute iota/compare/where inside the compiled AVX2 object (scalar
  descriptor loop mirroring the accepted SVE256 v5 plane, plus AVX2 fast
  paths for fully contiguous f32 compare/where); no host pre-expansion
- per-plan native/fallback metadata with explicit reasons and truthful
  position_control_fallback semantics; the vector-common host reference
  stays the bitwise semantic truth for every fallback
- tests: raw-bit differential matrix (f32/bf16/int/uint/bool; sNaN, qNaN,
  +/-0, +/-inf, subnormal, integer extremes), payload/ABI strictness,
  Qwen3.5 decode/prefill and attention corpus zero drift
- refresh the previous AVX2 payload/ABI version assertions to 7/:8

(cherry picked from commit 460f58506e92b3c696dbaa9af5a2ef254f78177a)
